The upstream editor originated in the GPUI Kit block editor work:
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit/pull/3049
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit/pull/3566

The incorporated engine in src/native_editor has been modified for structured
document interchange, stable external node identities, editor composition,
selection and table behavior, native code editing, per-instance presentation,
and integration into this crate. The upstream standalone themed wrapper and
optional formatting toolbar have been removed.
